Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.34,0:00:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want the borders\Nopened either, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be honest with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you were desperate enough\Nto go to a pirate to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,buy the weapons you needed\Nto fight their kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost as if\Neverything's a big joke, Tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.02,0:00:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be hurting after\Nthe loss of your arms broker,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dothamingo, and now with\Nyour veil of anonymity gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you have no choice but\Nto deal with us directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.26,0:00:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realize we have the upper hand\Nwhen you're in a position like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't be making\Nsuch unreasonable demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've seen Wano, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.56,0:00:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're as self-sufficient\Nas they come, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The people of Wano look awfully happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you've noticed that yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.06,0:01:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Although there's one thing\Nwe're always in need of,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.56,0:01:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's more power in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.66,0:01:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My request was a warship before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, we demand Dr. Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.72,0:01:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.04,0:01:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't asking, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Celestial dragons, the navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have caught on by now that the\Nland of Wano fears none of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.44,0:01:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you pulled your\Nforces together to attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.98,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd never be able to bring\Nour nation to its knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have Kaido on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.42,0:02:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I am unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.88,0:02:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.24,0:02:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.90,0:02:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.14,0:02:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing, no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.12,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.92,0:03:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.28,0:03:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're closed, they\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.38,0:03:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.42,0:03:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.88,0:03:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way,\Nmarks maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.04,0:03:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.12,0:03:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead to new horizons in view.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.36,0:03:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining brightly, oh, who\Nknows what's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.84,0:03:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:03:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.72,0:04:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Komurasaki is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.08,0:04:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm late, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.10,0:04:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You had me worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry I can't be waiting so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's get to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Komonosaki is approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The procession's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.94,0:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.88,0:05:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty hefty\Ncrowd she's got riled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You think she's as pretty as they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.52,0:05:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate that bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.44,0:05:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.34,0:05:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like they want trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.28,0:05:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.72,0:05:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to murder her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.62,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being expelled from the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.64,0:05:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm destined to die anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take her down, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from the Oiran, you trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.92,0:06:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.83,0:06:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would she do this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.92,0:06:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to be by your side forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.94,0:06:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If only it were possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to be with an\Nold bag of bones like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If I have no choice but to stay\Nhere as the Shogun's plaything,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,then I would much rather have my\Ncontract sold to a kind man such as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But the price of my freedom is\Nso steep, I fear it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have spoken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.88,0:06:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Shogun were to hear I said such\Na thing, I would surely face his wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You must not lose heart, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that really bring\Nyou true happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Say the word and I, bingo,\Nshall make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You would do that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I am delighted to hear it,\Neven if nothing comes to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean you can't pay me back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.44,0:07:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.92,0:07:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you take me for a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Crying won't bail you\Nout, so just knock it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take your house as\Ncollateral for the overdue loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, m 'lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That is quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen such wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is going to be the down payment so\Nthat I may buy you from the pleasure hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not enough, but do hold on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.76,0:07:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to mark\Nthis in the ledger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need to bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a fool would have\Ndistrust in the woman he loves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.92,0:07:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your word will do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're too kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.26,0:08:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I long for the day we go home together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.42,0:08:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to organize the funeral for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll front the money until\Nyou get back on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop with the crying already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't act surprised\Nthat you owe me double!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't expect a\Nfavor to come without a fee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is your money, my love. Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I fear I'd bear ill tidings.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, my love?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.10,0:08:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that another man is interested
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,in buying my contract and\Nhas put in a bid. Hey, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to gather more\Nmoney before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What else can I sell around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I sold everything I own, Gomorrah Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so lucky to have met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the final straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm moving back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.54,0:09:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've abandoned my family for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.92,0:09:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can just tough it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.08,0:09:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Medicine is a waste of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.44,0:09:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The quicker I can get your payment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the sooner we can live\Ntogether happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.62,0:09:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.00,0:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My love, I dream of that day too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Murasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.06,0:10:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The deed is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.58,0:10:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I may no longer have a place to live,\Nbut I have all the money in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.36,0:10:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We can build from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the final 500 gold coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.76,0:10:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.00,0:10:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The day is finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the oiron is unwell today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.16,0:10:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.88,0:10:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, please make sure\Nthis gets into her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I will return soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.14,0:10:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to save you\Nfrom this wretched life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're free to come home with me at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.58,0:11:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going, you old love-struck pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.76,0:11:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite enough laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go fetch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.56,0:11:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize she's expecting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We have both been looking\Nforward to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.04,0:11:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You really believed in all that crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.30,0:11:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She has enough money to free her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.48,0:11:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been saving it up\Nfor a while, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Komunasaki's holding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, bingo. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.14,0:11:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm delighted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you explain our\Nrelationship to these skeptics,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,as they don't seem to believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.02,0:11:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.58,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,As I recall, our relationship is that\Nyou provide me with money and I keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.10,0:11:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.90,0:12:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already spent it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.72,0:12:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That old Greg really thought that\NKomurasaki fell in love with him?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.72,0:12:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.24,0:12:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They're a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.64,0:12:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this geezer bothering you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.82,0:12:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The boss Kyoshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.82,0:12:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the filthy old stalker who's\Nbeen harassing Komodosaki lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.60,0:12:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Our love was not fictitious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Komodosaki, tell him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:13:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you, don't tell me\Nthis was all for naught.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The sacrifices I made,\Nthere's nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I threw away everything I had.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.56,0:13:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of many, old-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let you cry here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bad for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.22,0:13:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Having some trouble standing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.48,0:13:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You got ripped off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.48,0:13:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.44,0:13:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.08,0:13:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Murasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.40,0:14:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The top Oiran's procession\Nis coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way for her passage!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.60,0:14:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.60,0:14:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.08,0:14:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys seeing this too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.02,0:14:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, her glove!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuburasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I sold my house and family to be with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.30,0:14:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back to me, you swindler!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:15:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I trusted you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Return the gift you gave to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You are pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.88,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, men are nothing more\Nthan dogs that fetch me riches.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.52,0:15:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,With nothing left to give\Nme, you are worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.68,0:15:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escaping now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.50,0:15:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give us trouble, you peasants.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no place in the Flower\NCapital for you lousy deadbeats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In the name of Shogun Orochi,\Nwe banish you from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have mercy on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,None of us are suited for\Nliving outside of the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Dem you all to hell! Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.00,0:15:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, your pleas fall upon deaf ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:15:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I resent the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.64,0:16:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.66,0:16:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oiran Komurasaki has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you got a little\Nsister out there, Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.26,0:16:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Manners Tama, who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.66,0:16:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You should address me properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:16:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your momo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.74,0:17:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She would be 26 years old now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.36,0:17:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,While some have witnessed\Nmy mother's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.78,0:17:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,none have been able to confirm Hiyori's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have faith my sister's\Nout there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I only pray that she is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope you get to meet her soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.34,0:17:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.56,0:17:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If her identity is known, Then\NOrochi will set his sights on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot seek her out until\Nwe have claimed our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.40,0:17:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You were late because you were gawking at\Nthe Oiron, and you want me to excuse that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.52,0:17:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty as charged, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can forgive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.70,0:17:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in awe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.32,0:17:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Never saw someone so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.90,0:17:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,On one hand, I can't\Nreally blame you, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.84,0:18:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But honor dictates that you need to respect\Nthe fact that I'm your superior here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I never meant to bring dishonor\Nto the name of Minatomo,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.12,0:18:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the legendary Master Carpenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you work ten times harder\Nthan most, you get a freebie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.98,0:18:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't make this crap a habit. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,since we're on the topic of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.52,0:18:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,how about you show me\Nthe Onigashima Mansion
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,blueprints and I'll work 20 times as hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How does a hundred times\Nthe efficiency sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep on asking me about those.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I had something I wanted to\Ntell you concerning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One second. Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta clear the honker\Nbefore we get to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:18:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where I saw him last.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.18,0:19:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Pawned those suckers\Noff about ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you think I was\Nslaving away under you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.84,0:19:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you senile or were\Nyou just lying to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.72,0:19:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You must think really highly of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.82,0:19:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To put your hands on the master carpenter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,you ungrateful Long!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.42,0:19:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never get that time back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Suck on this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.42,0:19:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Frenosuke Rocket Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.74,0:19:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're fired!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You take your sorry ass out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need this job!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking me about a\Npawn from ten years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.42,0:20:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,we rarely take blueprints in honestly
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.64,0:20:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,does ring a bell though yeah and
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.06,0:20:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,they're still here I'm afraid not\Nif I recall correctly they're gone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's been quite a while let me think
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.80,0:20:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,oh
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the guy from the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.12,0:20:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,tenement he was looking to study\Nthem Kamakiri who the hell's that guy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.84,0:20:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamakiri the mansion outline yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.66,0:20:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,i did have one of those things at
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.60,0:20:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,one point but then i wanted to\Nfollow behind on my rent my landlord
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,took them from me kobe now who's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:21:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,this old dude kobe i do recall them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.04,0:21:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,they were quite remarkable so I gifted\Nthem away to my favorite geisha, Kisagawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.44,0:21:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.76,0:21:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I used them as dish\Nmats till I got scolded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone named Tokujito\Ntook them away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.82,0:21:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, so what's their deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They were stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rocket said they were worth a\Ngreat deal and ran off with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that can't be what he looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.42,0:21:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That is a camel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.28,0:21:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm Rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.82,0:21:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All that blueprint crap brought me\Nnothing but headaches and trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Some dirty bastard made\Noff with him in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't get to see his face, but\Nhe mentioned he came from Cootie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.26,0:21:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,More than certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.76,0:21:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sea Bream.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be a new breed or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your purchase.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Surfer Nose Kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.56,0:22:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you seem full of energy all damn\Nday hey what are you selling there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.50,0:22:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,can't you tell i'm a fishmonger\Nyou're sticking out way too much you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.18,0:22:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,got a whole audience of kids i\Ncouldn't help but notice but why were
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.34,0:22:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you in such a rush just now were you\Nseeking assistance with something
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,actually never mind what\Ni said about sticking
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,out there's a problem my plan to get those
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.56,0:22:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,blueprints were a total\Nbust i've been chasing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.26,0:22:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,down the damn things all\Nday let's begin inspecting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.94,0:22:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,the swords we've gathered thus far is that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.26,0:22:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,so that's quite the\Ndevelopment you believe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,they're in cootie right\Nnow uh-huh but i hit
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.78,0:22:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,a dead end on the trail\Ngot no more leads man i
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,don't know what to do\Nwith this point regardless
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.02,0:22:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks for trying i can take over please
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.32,0:22:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,go support the other\Nmissions about the capital
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.60,0:23:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you got it click hmm\Nnow who would want the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.66,0:23:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,layout of kaito's mansion\Nbesides us could it be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.62,0:23:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.34,0:23:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,stole as much as
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.60,0:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,possible the food of course
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,and these weapons as\Nwell excellent work and
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.08,0:23:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,one of the other part\NIt's been taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sure it's okay, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.98,0:23:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we gonna just make\Nthe Beast Pirates really mad
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.36,0:23:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,at our Shit Doji by leaving\Nthe notes saying he did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.50,0:23:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That is precisely the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.62,0:23:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall goad him into fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.64,0:23:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He will have no other choice but to defend\Nhimself once they seek revenge on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.52,0:23:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to force him\Nto reignite his spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.36,0:23:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The man has suffered a lot the\Npast two decades, hasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels a bit too\Nhigh-handed, if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.76,0:23:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps so.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.08,0:24:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our method may be dishonest, but he's\Nan invaluable asset for defeating Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.68,0:24:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We need his help to ensure our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.24,0:24:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, we are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.98,0:24:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.89,0:24:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.88,0:24:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.18,0:24:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't expect to\Nsee you yet, Tonoyasu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Yasuie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.56,0:24:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's always a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.84,0:24:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Still no food, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.62,0:24:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.18,0:24:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.10,0:24:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.84,0:24:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they're laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, very astute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.48,0:24:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You noticed already.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We love a good chuckle.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.08,0:24:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The hukaburitan seems\Ndreary by comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.44,0:25:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the living creatures in the\Nworld, only a human can laugh, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.20,0:25:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Best of all, it's free, so\Nwhy waste a beautiful thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.44,0:25:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is lousy, laugh it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.76,0:25:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is lousy, laugh it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.00,0:25:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive the intrusion!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.08,0:25:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.28,0:25:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be so reserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.64,0:25:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Now raise your heads for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.92,0:25:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you've\Nmade for dinner tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we're confident\Nthat you will enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.86,0:26:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We carefully selected\Nhands from the Orochi farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.08,0:26:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then our chefs gently\Nprepared them in a light boil.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.66,0:26:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't want chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, we shall discard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.78,0:26:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.48,0:26:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up, we've gathered the\Nmost fresh and ripe vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.20,0:26:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not in the mood. Dispose of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.86,0:26:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.16,0:26:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps some fatty, sorry, might\Nappease your distinguished palate.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.96,0:26:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That does sound delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.96,0:26:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pair it with tuna sashimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.30,0:26:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd settle for nothing less.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.04,0:26:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.20,0:26:31.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We also brought you a\Nhand-selected variety of
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.50,0:26:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,sakes from across the land\Nof Wano Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.86,0:26:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm more concerned about\Nthe assortment of women
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.74,0:26:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you've brought me What\Nabout my entertainment?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.38,0:26:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a top priority, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.10,0:26:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.14,0:26:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.05,0:26:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My tummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.22,0:26:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine hurts too!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.82,0:27:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.86,0:27:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lost another tooth\Nfrom lack of nourishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.14,0:27:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Not liking it in him anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.90,0:27:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie, why don't you introduce\Nus to your new rodent friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.02,0:27:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, three, did you bring\Nextras in case you break them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.34,0:27:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Check that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.80,0:27:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a triple threat!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.22,0:27:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, full-size Cotton, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.30,0:27:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That for a comedy bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.66,0:27:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.26,0:27:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to scare him off, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.24,0:27:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud of my cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.90,0:27:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, I'm sorry our local weirdo\Nwon't leave you be. Poor boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.46,0:27:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm still the world's\Ngreatest sycophant, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.34,0:27:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even believe this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.94,0:27:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What an upstanding fellow, I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.48,0:27:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I find him kind of scary, like a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.68,0:27:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.02,0:27:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.26,0:27:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Your whole life's ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.08,0:27:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.60,0:27:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, something great has happened\Nto our trashy little town today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.62,0:28:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A certain someone came to\Nvisit again, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.52,0:28:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,None other than Ushimitsu, Koza.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.96,0:28:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You just barely missed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.94,0:28:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that is lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.38,0:28:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he really?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.82,0:28:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, always seems to know\Nthe right time to drop by.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.84,0:28:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Though no one knows who\Nthat mystery man is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.44,0:28:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He visits every so often,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.64,0:28:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,showing up in the dead\Nof night after stealing
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.30,0:28:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,gold from the wicked\Nnobles of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.82,0:28:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Before vanishing into the dark,\Nhe spreads it around the slum.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.98,0:28:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What a kind soul, he's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.40,0:28:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness for whoever he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.00,0:28:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortune comes to those who can laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.14,0:28:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We were able to pull the money together\Nand get a little treat thanks to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.82,0:29:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of treat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.30,0:29:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to believe\Nthis! Come here! Look! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.32,0:29:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought you a cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.72,0:29:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.46,0:29:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's clean water.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.24,0:29:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We got it for the town with the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.00,0:29:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pass, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.54,0:29:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.08,0:29:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.24,0:29:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't make you feel yucky\Nlike our normal water does.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.74,0:29:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be here for a reason, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.44,0:29:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie saw something good in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.88,0:29:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the girl, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.22,0:29:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink up, don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.34,0:29:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our guy, don't question us why.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.32,0:29:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean and so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.16,0:29:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for your Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.42,0:29:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean and so yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.52,0:29:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for your Tommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.30,0:29:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean and so yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.86,0:29:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for your tummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.18,0:30:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean and so yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.92,0:30:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for your tummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.04,0:30:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean and so yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.38,0:30:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good for your tummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.98,0:30:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the spot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.98,0:30:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel it through your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.30,0:30:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.60,0:30:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, let me assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.08,0:30:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Browns will chase the good fortune away.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.18,0:30:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you about our secret, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.22,0:30:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In this country, we have a name\Nfor our trademark grin. You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.50,0:30:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably call it the Emmys' Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.36,0:30:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's where the place gets its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.20,0:30:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Poverty can't steal our smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.20,0:30:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no use crying when we get dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.64,0:30:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, life is lousy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.72,0:30:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.50,0:31:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring them to me! Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.32,0:31:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, as you say. But, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.66,0:31:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.88,0:31:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Such beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.06,0:31:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.94,0:31:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they meet your satisection, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.28,0:31:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.42,0:31:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.30,0:31:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.22,0:31:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The banquet may commence now!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.76,0:31:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink, dance, and sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.70,0:31:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us be merry!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.30,0:31:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.38,0:32:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm over here, Oko Murasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.80,0:32:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How nice it is to see you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.08,0:32:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.00,0:32:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.20,0:32:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Traffy, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.58,0:32:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.74,0:32:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's bail, Blackleg.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.30,0:32:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.36,0:32:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it about the fight before?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.88,0:32:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kick their ass\Nagain if they come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.14,0:32:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.05,0:32:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,People who know our\Nfaces are on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.94,0:32:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hawkins, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.98,0:32:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That we can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.42,0:32:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's got backup with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.62,0:32:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Toby Rope are the top six headliners.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.44,0:32:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They sent two.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.35,0:32:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.94,0:32:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.30,0:32:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The first is page one
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.14,0:33:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to ask who's the other\Nthat's Diaz Drake no more questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.90,0:33:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd better start moving
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.64,0:33:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.70,0:33:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the worst generation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.76,0:33:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Page one, why must we\Nstoop to this lowly task?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.18,0:33:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Need it spelled out?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.00,0:33:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's to set an example,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.66,0:33:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to show what happens to someone stupid\Nenough to set foot in the land of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.46,0:33:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And ballsy enough to\Ncross the beast, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.08,0:33:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.80,0:33:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you here then, Hawkins?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.22,0:33:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in search of a particular man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.98,0:33:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find this mission to be more\Nthan you bargained for. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.68,0:34:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.38,0:34:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Buddy, think it over yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.86,0:34:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're planning on busting out, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.92,0:34:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've got a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give in and let me tag along.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.80,0:34:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,think of the benefits if we team\Nup not a soul could get in our
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.40,0:34:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,way oh shut it go fuck jaggy to\Nbe your partner ally with kid
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.62,0:34:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,no thank you his entire reputation\Nis tanked you hear he tried
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.80,0:34:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,to go after big mom and fell\Nmiserably no one wants to go anywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.18,0:34:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,near that rumors aren't good\Neither they say the loser's arm
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.08,0:34:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,wasn't ripped off by the old bag\Nherself but by one of her weaker
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.40,0:34:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,underlings way
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.88,0:34:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,it's true though
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.16,0:34:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it directly from a
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.82,0:34:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,very reliable source scalp's
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.14,0:35:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,honor either your source is full of
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,crap or you need to get your\Nears checked you heard wrong I
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,went to a turf but never to fight\Nbig mom hey kid good see ya for
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.56,0:35:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the record I beat one of her sweet\Ngenerals I went there to steal
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.14,0:35:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,something and I made off with it\Nfine I believe ya but your arm
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.14,0:35:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,is yeah what about my arm I\Nlost it in a battle against the
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.88,0:35:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,red-haired pirates before all\Nthat junk went down need any more
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.92,0:35:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,facts that's straight no good then\Nlet me be clear about something
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.92,0:35:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,else so listen up you're stupid\Nmonkey this is It's my victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.98,0:35:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one that takes down Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.06,0:35:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.64,0:35:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.10,0:35:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God! Chouchou!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.08,0:35:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.92,0:36:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The festival draws closer, but\Nthe celebration starts now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.16,0:36:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejoice!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.10,0:36:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy ourselves in\Nthis great land of water!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.66,0:36:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.57,0:36:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Indulge till your heart's full!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.28,0:36:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the closest you'll\Nget to heaven in this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.70,0:36:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.90,0:36:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We have intel!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.02,0:36:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A ship is approaching\Nfrom the southeast side!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.22,0:36:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't believe she really came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.66,0:36:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That old shrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.20,0:36:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.48,0:36:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her and her family\Nbe swallowed by the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.10,0:36:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell everyone to unleash\Ntheir attacks then, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.28,0:36:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let that hang in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.22,0:36:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,They've wrangled a koi fish into\Npulling their vessel upstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.04,0:36:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,They what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.08,0:37:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How do they know about the method\Nwe use to climb the waterfall?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.52,0:37:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.06,0:37:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,when it comes to gathering intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.80,0:37:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,they say Big Mom's the\Nbest in the business!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.20,0:37:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.60,0:37:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.06,0:37:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose we knew they\Nwere coming either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.90,0:37:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just seek her ship already!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.20,0:37:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That crazy witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.80,0:37:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it crystal clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.10,0:37:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She may be old, but she's not senile.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.82,0:37:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You showed up, Lin-Lin, and now you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.40,0:38:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.68,0:38:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.64,0:39:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from\Nme that easily, Straw Hat.
